  "description": "Cruise control. The SI 24 is full-sized fun. An upsized 6000 series aluminum frame rolls on smooth and steady 24\" wheels for bigger/older/faster riders who want more stability or want to hit the track in the cruiser class. Sturdy benefactors like a chromoly fork and 3-piece chromoly cranks can take the rough landings and serve double duty at the pump track. Kenda Kontact tires roll fast and grip great. When you're ready to roll, the SI is willing and able.\n6061 series alloy frame with 3D dropouts with integrated chain tensioners\n100% chromoly fork\nHaro 3-piece chromoly 8-spline race cranks\nPadded one piece seat with built in alloy post\nKenda Kontact tires",
